And so, this is like

00:50:32.046 --> 00:50:36.035
a three or four-year-old paper
at least and so.

00:50:36.036 --> 00:50:37.870
&gt;&gt; Implementations on IT PIR?

00:50:37.871 --> 00:50:40.195
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:50:40.196 --> 00:50:43.135
Yeah, I mean I didn't

00:50:43.136 --> 00:50:44.965
